            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Gujarati for half-finished, then the Gujarati for final."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: અવધિ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "અવધિ — avdhi — \"a time limit\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "જો તમે આ અવધિમાં અરજી નહીં કરો તો તમે આ તક ગુમાવશો. jo tame ā avdhimā̃ arjī nahī̃ karo to tame ā tak gumāvśo. If you don't apply within this time limit, you will lose this chance."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A feminine noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "અવધિ (avdhi) is a tatsama, taken from Sanskrit avadhi, \"a term, a limit\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for saying what happens if."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
