          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઠેલવું (ṭhelvũ) comes from ṭhēḍḍ, a form CDIAL reconstructs, and CDIAL lists the Gujarati verb as \"to push\" (CDIAL 5512); a plan or a date is pushed back."
            }
          ]
        },
